<title>AUSTRALIA: GOLF-AUSTRALIAN PGA FIRST ROUND SCORES.</title>
<headline>GOLF-AUSTRALIAN PGA FIRST ROUND SCORES.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading first round scores in the</p>
<p>Australian PGA tournament at the par-72 New South Wales Golf</p>
<p>Club on Thursday (Australian unless stated):</p>
<p>66 Wayne Riley, Bryan Roach</p>
<p>68 Chris Gray, Grant Waite (New Zealand), Robin Byrd (U.S), Ben</p>
<p>Jackson (Britain)</p>
<p>69 Darren Clarke (Britain), Jamie Taylor</p>
<p>70 Craig Carmichael, David Hill, Grant Kenny, John Wagner,</p>
<p>Marcus Wheelhouse (New Zealand), Michael Long (New Zealand),</p>
<p>Shane Tait, Chris Hearn, Justin Cooper, Ossie Moore, Tony</p>
<p>Carolan</p>
